      "description": "kW from 15-min kWh slots, from the E31 community aggregate. Two things differ from the VM original beyond syntax: (1) the constant label that worked around VM's flat namespace is gone -- the table name scopes it now; (2) product_code is replaced by segment ('cel'/'grid'), which is the same distinction under the name the parser actually stores. product_code would work identically; segment is used because it survives a provider-side encoding change (see classify_metric_type in models.py).",
